repository-code: "https://github.com/sohaibrana1/xmssmt-layer-adaptive-rpi5"
date-released: 2026-09-19
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for an empirical Raspberry Pi 5 study of
  layer-adaptive XMSSMT parameterization. The repository contains the
  validated heterogeneous XMSSMT source modifications, processed benchmark
  datasets, analysis scripts, provenance records, publication figures,
  supplementary material, and SHA-256 integrity manifests.
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - hash-based signatures
  - XMSSMT
  - XMSS
  - WOTS+
  - BDS traversal
  - heterogeneous parameterization
  - Raspberry Pi 5
  - cryptographic engineering

